01:08:06.960 --> 01:08:09.180
Yeah.
When I looked

01:08:09.180 --> 01:08:12.370
at my schedule back in
the day, it was like,

01:08:12.370 --> 01:08:14.420
oh you gotta do an Ear Biscuit
and you're not prepared

01:08:14.420 --> 01:08:18.000
for that person, it felt
like ah, you got a test.

01:08:18.000 --> 01:08:20.710
But when I see you've
got an Ear Biscuit today

01:08:20.710 --> 01:08:25.030
on the schedule and even if
I haven't prepared for it,

01:08:25.030 --> 01:08:27.770
I'm like ah, that's something
I look forward to doing.

01:08:27.770 --> 01:08:31.880
It's a creative outlet
and it's a mental outlet,

01:08:31.880 --> 01:08:34.070
it's an emotional outlet,
it's a lot of things for us

01:08:34.070 --> 01:08:39.070
