for what it is for us

01:08:39.270 --> 01:08:41.890
and I'm grateful for what
it is for you listening

01:08:41.890 --> 01:08:45.080
and I just wanna thank you for listening.

01:08:45.080 --> 01:08:49.440
At what point you started
listening, that's fine,

01:08:49.440 --> 01:08:51.110
maybe you don't wanna go back
and listen to all of 'em,

01:08:51.110 --> 01:08:52.203
