01:08:52.203 --> 01:08:55.550
What's most important is that you're here

01:08:55.550 --> 01:08:57.440
and that you enjoy hanging out with us,

01:08:57.440 --> 01:08:58.973
puttin' us in your ears.

01:09:00.200 --> 01:09:04.726
Thank you for sharing Ear
Biscuits with other people and--

01:09:04.726 --> 01:09:09.057
Anybody that you know that
what this show has become,

01:09:09.057 --> 01:09:11.423
if you think that they
would connect with it,

01:09:12.263 --> 01:09:14.620
