with something that's
gonna be underwhelming.

01:09:40.183 --> 01:09:41.830
Well--
If you got something good,

01:09:41.830 --> 01:09:44.373
yes, if you don't, let's
just keep it a mystery.

01:09:45.260 --> 01:09:47.630
We'll keep it a mystery,

01:09:47.630 --> 01:09:49.920
but I do have a quick Rec in Effect

01:09:49.920 --> 01:09:50.940
I'm gonna leave you with.

01:09:50.940 --> 01:09:53.120
This is one that Link
has a little insight into

01:09:53.120 --> 01:09:55.920
because I shared this
rec with him yesterday.

01:09:55.920 --> 01:10:00.920
And I shared this rec not so
much as a pure recommendation

01:10:01.640 --> 01:10:04.450
that I'm going all in on this

01:10:04.450 --> 01:10:07.530
because I have questions about this rec

01:10:07.530 --> 01:10:10.370
that I want you to explore with me, okay.

01:10:10.370 --> 01:10:12.840
Now you may know, we've
talked about this before,

01:10:12.840 --> 01:10:15.360
Primitive Technology, one of
our favorite YouTube channels,

01:10:15.360 --> 01:10:17.860
this guy somewhere in Australia
who does all this stuff

01:10:17.860 --> 01:10:22.580
with stone-age tools, never
talks, there's no music,

01:10:22.580 --> 01:10:25.780
never looks at the camera
and he just builds stuff

01:10:25.780 --> 01:10:27.210
and it's amazing.

01:10:27.210 --> 01:10:32.210
Well as you might expect, he
essentially created a genre

01:10:32.360 --> 01:10:35.030
of YouTube videos and now
there are other people

01:10:35.030 --> 01:10:37.053
following suit and doing the same thing.

01:10:38.300 --> 01:10:42.080
There's a guy, I'm gonna say this wrong,

01:10:42.080 --> 01:10:46.070
but his channel is Mr. Heang Update.

01:10:46.070 --> 01:10:48.670
And I believe it's Mr. dot--

01:10:48.670 --> 01:10:50.190
H-A-U-N-G.

01:10:50.190 --> 01:10:52.970
No, H-E-A-N-G.

01:10:52.970 --> 01:10:53.803
There's no U.

01:10:53.803 --> 01:10:56.570
Heang, I think, but there's no space

01:10:56.570 --> 01:10:58.940
after the period in mister either.

01:10:58.940 --> 01:11:02.123
At least in the YouTube
channel, Mr. Heang Update.

01:11:03.138 --> 01:11:05.425
And he's got a bunch of videos.

01:11:05.425 --> 01:11:10.425
There's two from the past
couple months that he built

01:11:11.890 --> 01:11:15.630
this under, well, this
is the confusing thing.

01:11:15.630 --> 01:11:17.180
Link and I watched both videos.

01:11:18.490 --> 01:11:23.330
Using a stick, he dug into a huge pit

01:11:23.330 --> 01:11:25.470
and it's like this incredible dwelling.

01:11:25.470 --> 01:11:27.874
He made a submerged dwelling--

01:11:27.874 --> 01:11:29.550
That has a pool in it.

01:11:29.550 --> 01:11:31.470
In the bottom of it there is a pool.

01:11:31.470 --> 01:11:34.780
And he did one video, like
a 15 minute long video

01:11:34.780 --> 01:11:37.070
where he does this and it's awesome

01:11:37.070 --> 01:11:39.680
and then he did a second
video which included footage

01:11:39.680 --> 01:11:42.400
from the same exact video, was
released around the same time

01:11:42.400 --> 01:11:44.520
but then he put a roof on it.

01:11:44.520 --> 01:11:46.680
Yeah and made it where you
couldn't see it at all,

01:11:46.680 --> 01:11:48.910
it was like it wasn't even there.

01:11:48.910 --> 01:11:52.390
Regardless of the nature
of how this all happens,

01:11:52.390 --> 01:11:54.670
it is amazing and you should watch that.

01:11:54.670 --> 01:11:56.780
But the assignment and
the question is what?

01:11:56.780 --> 01:12:00.203
The assignment is
between those two videos,

01:12:01.536 --> 01:12:04.870
I don't understand why he
decided to do one with a roof

01:12:04.870 --> 01:12:07.070
and one without a roof, release
them around the same time

01:12:07.070 --> 01:12:09.820
and include footage of
both things but also,

01:12:09.820 --> 01:12:12.000
to go and look at other things,

01:12:12.000 --> 01:12:14.238
I feel like with Primitive Technology,

01:12:14.238 --> 01:12:17.170
every single thing that
he does is documented

01:12:17.170 --> 01:12:19.290
and you know that he didn't get any help.

01:12:19.290 --> 01:12:22.760
My question about Mr. Heang is,

01:12:22.760 --> 01:12:25.300
is he really doing all this himself?

01:12:25.300 --> 01:12:26.530
I want to believe,

01:12:26.530 --> 01:12:29.090
I want to believe he's
doing it all himself,

01:12:29.090 --> 01:12:31.920
but I have my suspicions
because first of all,

01:12:31.920 --> 01:12:34.030
we know he has a cameraman
because the camera moves

01:12:34.030 --> 01:12:35.860
when he's in the--
Don't give 'em the answers.

01:12:35.860 --> 01:12:37.100
Let 'em look into it.

01:12:37.100 --> 01:12:39.430
Primitive Technology doesn't
seem to have a cameraman.

01:12:39.430 --> 01:12:41.520
But there's also many steps
in Mr. Heang's process

01:12:41.520 --> 01:12:43.073
that you don't see.

01:12:44.860 --> 01:12:46.290
That's the Rec in Effect.

01:12:46.290 --> 01:12:50.620
